The '''Personal Bank Item''' is a {{Common}} item used to access the [[Bank]] remotely. The cooldown of the item is the same as the cooldown of the player's personal bank.

== Usage ==
Right-clicking with the '''Personal Bank Item''' will open the [[Bank|Banking]] interface, whilst left-clicking will deposit all {{c}} in the player's purse. 

